      <p class="route-card__why">Solve structured problems.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Firms.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Case write-ups.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Competitive.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move toward manager.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="route-card">
      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">04</span>
        <span class="chip chip--mid">Scalable with a business layer</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Research roles</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Test questions with evidence.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Institutes.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Research notes.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Slow.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move toward research lead.</p>
